msgstr "Le relevé source nomme explicitement gmeow:taggerTime."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/untracked|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring object completeness, ownership or successful Git execution from untracked alone."
msgstr "Éviter de déduire complétude des objets, propriété ou exécution Git réussie de untracked seul."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/untracked|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the explicit untracked value with its source and observation scope."
msgstr "Conserver la valeur explicite de untracked avec sa source et sa portée d’observation."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/untracked|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain untracked in an attributed repository description."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver non suivie dans une description de dépôt attribuée."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/untracked|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "untracked"
msgstr "non suivie"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/untracked|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicit report that this working entry is untracked. Absence is unknown; false does not assert committed-tree membership or a clean working file."
msgstr "Rapport explicite indiquant que l’entrée n’est pas suivie. L’absence est inconnue ; faux n’affirme ni appartenance à un arbre validé ni fichier propre."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/untracked|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record names gmeow:untracked explicitly."
msgstr "Le relevé source nomme explicitement gmeow:untracked."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve Git repository object format presence constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte de présence du format d’objet Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Git repository object format presence constraint"
msgstr "contrainte de présence du format d’objet Git"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A repository classified as Git explicitly names its selected object format; non-Git repositories gain no required field."
msgstr "Un dépôt classé Git nomme explicitement son format d’objet ; les dépôts non Git n’acquièrent aucun champ obligatoire."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:GitRepositoryHasObjectFormatConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve Git repository object format uniqueness constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte d’unicité du format d’objet Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Git repository object format uniqueness constraint"
msgstr "contrainte d’unicité du format d’objet Git"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One Git repository selects one object format; conflicting selections do not define a mixed format."
msgstr "Un dépôt Git sélectionne un format ; des sélections contradictoires ne définissent pas un format mixte."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:GitRepositoryHasOneObjectFormatConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve parent occurrence reified tuple constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte du tuple réifié de l’occurrence de parent."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "parent occurrence reified tuple constraint"
msgstr "contrainte du tuple réifié de l’occurrence de parent"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every listed parent occurrence is an actual RDF 1.2 reifier. The consumer reads child and parent from that tuple and checks the owning commit scope."
msgstr "Chaque occurrence listée est un réificateur RDF 1.2 réel. Le consommateur lit enfant et parent dans ce tuple et vérifie la portée du commit propriétaire."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:ParentOccurrenceHasReifiedTupleConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve parent occurrence sequence scope constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte de portée de séquence de l’occurrence de parent."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "parent occurrence sequence scope constraint"
msgstr "contrainte de portée de séquence de l’occurrence de parent"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One occurrence identity belongs to one sequence; repeated targets or another recorded sequence use distinct occurrence identities."
msgstr "Une identité d’occurrence appartient à une séquence ; des cibles répétées ou une autre séquence enregistrée utilisent des identités distinctes."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:ParentOccurrenceSequenceScopeConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve parent ordinal uniqueness in sequence constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte d’unicité d’ordinal dans la séquence des parents."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "parent ordinal uniqueness in sequence constraint"
msgstr "contrainte d’unicité d’ordinal dans la séquence des parents"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Two different occurrence records in one parent sequence cannot claim the same ordinal. Equal parent targets at different positions remain permitted."
msgstr "Deux occurrences distinctes d’une séquence ne peuvent revendiquer le même ordinal. Des parents identiques à des positions différentes restent permis."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:ParentOrdinalUniqueInSequenceConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve parent sequence commit scope constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte de portée du commit de la séquence des parents."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "parent sequence commit scope constraint"
msgstr "contrainte de portée du commit de la séquence des parents"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One recorded parent sequence belongs to one commit. Its occurrence tuple scope is interpreted against that commit by the consumer."
msgstr "Une séquence enregistrée appartient à un commit. Le consommateur interprète la portée des tuples de ses occurrences relativement à ce commit."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:ParentSequenceCommitScopeConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve tagger identity timestamp constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte d’horodatage de l’identité du créateur d’étiquette."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tagger identity timestamp constraint"
msgstr "contrainte d’horodatage de l’identité du créateur d’étiquette"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported tagger identity retains its corresponding tagger timestamp; tags with no tagger header acquire no invented identity or time."
msgstr "Une identité de créateur rapportée conserve son horodatage correspondant ; une étiquette sans en-tête de créateur n’acquiert aucune identité ni date inventée."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:TaggerIdentityHasTimeConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve tagger timestamp identity constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte d’identité de l’horodatage du créateur d’étiquette."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tagger timestamp identity constraint"
msgstr "contrainte d’identité de l’horodatage du créateur d’étiquette"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reported tagger timestamp retains the historical identity whose header supplied it; it is not a commit author-time statement."
msgstr "Un horodatage rapporté conserve l’identité historique dont l’en-tête le fournit ; ce n’est pas un instant d’auteur de commit."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:TaggerTimeHasIdentityConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve tree path entry immediate owner constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte du propriétaire immédiat de l’entrée de chemin."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tree path entry immediate owner constraint"
msgstr "contrainte du propriétaire immédiat de l’entrée de chemin"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A terminal entry selected by a path occurrence names its immediate containing tree. That tree need not equal the path root."
msgstr "Une entrée terminale sélectionnée nomme l’arbre qui la contient immédiatement. Cet arbre n’a pas à être la racine du chemin."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:TreePathEntryHasImmediateOwnerConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint as a traversal, hashing or Git execution certificate."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint comme certificat de parcours, de hachage ou d’exécution Git."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint to the explicitly scoped source records."
msgstr "Appliquer TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint aux relevés sources de portée explicite."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve same represented tree path terminal constraint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver contrainte de terminaison du même chemin représenté."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "same represented tree path terminal constraint"
msgstr "contrainte de terminaison du même chemin représenté"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one root tree, identical represented path literals name the same terminal entry. Cross-encoding byte identity and actual traversal remain consumer obligations."
msgstr "Sous une racine, des littéraux de chemin représentés identiques nomment la même entrée terminale. L’identité des octets entre encodages et le parcours réel restent à la charge du consommateur."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "The source record is governed by gmeow:TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint."
msgstr "Le relevé source est régi par gmeow:TreePathSameLiteralHasSameEntryConstraint."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A recorded author, committer or tagger identity in a version-control object, retaining its historical raw bytes independently of the currently canonical agent. Superseded identities remain retained rather than rewritten."
msgstr "Identité d’auteur, de validateur ou de créateur d’étiquette enregistrée dans un objet de version, conservant les octets historiques indépendamment de l’agent canonique actuel. Les identités remplacées restent conservées plutôt que réécrites."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Ref|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A version-control reference to an object, including commit, tree, blob or annotated tag targets. It is distinct from the immutable object it names; observed target claims retain their own provenance and scope."
msgstr "Référence de version vers un objet, notamment commit, arbre, blob ou étiquette annotée. Elle diffère de l’objet immuable nommé ; les cibles observées conservent leur provenance et leur portée."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/releaseTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The folksonomy Tag associated with a release, retaining the existing tag classification surface. Use releaseRef for a VCS tag reference; this property neither names an AnnotatedTag object nor changes the sort of existing Tag values."
msgstr "Tag de folksonomie associé à une publication, conservant la classification existante. Utiliser releaseRef pour une référence d’étiquette de version ; cette propriété ne nomme pas un objet AnnotatedTag et ne change pas la sorte des valeurs Tag existantes."


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorIdentityString|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The raw author, committer or tagger identity bytes recorded in a version-control object header, typically Name <email>, preserved independently of canonical agent resolution."
msgstr "Octets bruts de l’identité d’auteur, de validateur ou de créateur d’étiquette enregistrés dans un en-tête d’objet de version, généralement Name <email>, conservés indépendamment de la résolution de l’agent canonique."
